      "id": "kinetempo-breathing-478",
      "name": "4-7-8 before sleep",
      "description": "Four seconds in through the nose, seven held, eight out through the mouth with the lips barely parted. Four cycles, lying down, once you are already in bed. Stop at four the first weeks — the long exhale can make you light-headed if you overdo it.",
